'''Master hunters' loot sacks''' are a reward for successfully completing master [[Hunters' Rumours]] assigned by [[Guild Hunter Wolf (Master)|Guild Hunter Wolf]].

Opening them rolls 11 times for resources, and also has a chance to reward the [[enhanced quetzal whistle blueprint]], the [[huntsman's kit]], and pieces of the [[guild hunter outfit]]. Master and [[Hunters' loot sack (expert)|expert]] sacks also drop [[perfected quetzal whistle blueprint]]s, and rarely the [[Quetzin]] [[pet]].

